A '''hangar''' was located on [[Geonosis]] which once held [[Count Dooku's solar sailer|Count Dooku's ''Punworcca 116-''class interstellar sloop]]. During the [[First Battle of Geonosis]], [[Count]] [[Dooku]] fought [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and [[Anakin Skywalker]] in a [[Lightsaber duel]]. After he defeated them both, he then fought [[Jedi Master]] [[Yoda]].<ref name="Episode II" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|That's Dooku's hangar. All of a sudden the guy gets his own hangar. He's only been here five minutes! I've been here five YEARS! Where's my hangar?|translated=1|A [[Geonosian]]|<ref name="LEGO">''[[LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga]]''</ref>}}
Dooku's hangar first appeared in [[Star Wars: Episode II Attack of the Clones|''Star Wars'': Episode II ''Attack of the Clones'']].<ref name="Episode II" />

